# Shift-Tab (D4a): ask, auto, full access and round, from the harness's
# `auto`, with the one-time full-access warning seen and then gone after its
# four seconds on the screen -- and not shown again on the way back in.
wait 2
snap start
key BTab
# The warning is snapped while it is up and once it has gone, each by
# the screen rather than by a second count against its 4 s (FLAKE-HINT4).
until shown Full access
wait 0.5
snap btab-full
# The frame itself holds the row it is for, or the run fails: the `until
# shown` before it was a look, and a wait came between (FLAKE-HINT4).
expect btab-full Full access
home btab-full
wait 4.5
until gone Full access
snap btab-full-later
home btab-full-later
key BTab
wait 0.5
snap btab-ask
home btab-ask
key BTab
wait 0.5
snap btab-auto
key BTab
wait 0.5
snap btab-full-again
type /permissions
wait 0.3
key Enter
wait 1
snap bare
home end
